values ('f4a5b6c7-8d9e-4f46-9a66-6b7c8d9e0f86', 'logistics-and-transportation-management', 'Logistics and Transportation Management', 'Logistics and Transportation Management prepares students to move goods through complex supply networks with discipline, speed, reliability, cost awareness, regulatory fluency, and resilience. Students study modal choice, carrier management, freight pricing, routing, distribution networks, warehousing interfaces, last-mile delivery, international logistics, customs compliance, transportation technology, analytics, sustainability, and disruption response. The course culminates in a professional transportation case in which students recommend and defend an executable logistics network decision.');

